{"ref":"BDB, שָׁתַק","hw":"שָׁתַק","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁתַק</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. be quiet</strong> (late) <strong>(</strong>NH id., <em>be silent;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁתַק</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁתֵיק</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܫܬܶܩ</span> <em>be quiet, silent</em> (cf. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁקַט\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁקַט\", dir=\"rtl\">שׁקט</a>)<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. 3 ms., of sea <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁתֹּק הַיָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:11\" href=\"/Jonah.1.11\">Jon 1:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:12\" href=\"/Jonah.1.12\">12</a> (sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵעַל</span>), of quarrel, strife <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.20\">Pr 26:20</a>; 3 mpl. of persons at sea, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁתֹּ֑קוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:30\" href=\"/Psalms.107.30\">ψ 107:30</a>.","next":"BDB, שֵׁתָר","prev":"BDB, שׁתן"}